      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MACKENZIE ROSE (1) has been settling off the speed lately, finishing sixth (24.79) last time in a Restricted WIN H at this track. Looks the one to beat on her best form. SOMERTON ANN (8) was well backed last start but ran below expectations when fourth (20.56), beaten 2.75 lengths. Expected to feature in the finish. NICKED AGAIN (6) was responsible for a modest effort most recently when fifth at this track over 435m behind Mugshot (25.17) in a Grade 5. Goes very well from this draw with two wins and two minor placings from four starts. Key runner who gets his chance to atone. IT'S FRIDAY (3) was well fancied in betting last start but could only manage 2.5 lengths away in third (20.54). Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings five times from seven attempts. Overdue and is among the main hopes.",
